msgstr ""
"Åtgärdat en regression i Django 2.0 där ``FileSystemStorage`` kraschar med "
"``FileExistsError`` om samtidiga sparningar försöker skapa samma katalog (:"
"ticket:`29890`)."

msgid "Django 2.1.4 release notes"
msgstr "Django 2.1.4 release notes"

msgid "Django 2.1.4 fixes several bugs in 2.1.3."
msgstr "Django 2.1.4 åtgärdar flera buggar i 2.1.3."

msgid ""
"Corrected the default password list that ``CommonPasswordValidator`` uses by "
"lowercasing all passwords to match the format expected by the validator (:"
"ticket:`29952`)."
msgstr ""
"Korrigerade standardlösenordslistan som ``CommonPasswordValidator`` använder "
