"``LooseVersion`` (:ticket:`29959`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed keep-alive support in ``runserver`` after it was disabled to fix "
"another issue in Django 2.0 (:ticket:`29849`)."
msgstr ""
"Fixat keep-alive-stöd i ``runserver`` efter att det inaktiverats för att "
"lösa ett annat problem i Django 2.0 (:ticket:`29849`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed admin view-only change form crash when using ``ModelAdmin."
"prepopulated_fields`` (:ticket:`29929`)."
msgstr ""
"Fixad krasch i ändringsformuläret för administratörsvisning när ``ModelAdmin."
"prepopulated_fields`` används (:ticket:`29929`)."

msgid ""
"Fixed \"Please correct the errors below\" error message when editing an "
